# flag with a sign. Smokegod (60) sets and clears a fido's (3062) blindness, with the sign written on the flag's
# name (+blind) and apart from it (+ blind), and stats the fido after each. flag took the whole first word as the
# sign, so +blind changed nothing ("Which flags do you wish to change?"), and when it worked it said nothing
# (#68). Now both ways set and clear it, and flag says "Ok.".
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@mob 3062 3001
flag mob fido aff +blind
stat fido
flag mob fido aff -blind
stat fido
flag mob fido aff + blind
stat fido
flag mob fido aff - blind
stat fido
